'' AN IMPORTER'S MACROS DO NOT REACH AN INTERFACE (RFC-0004 §5): '-d Add_=Broken_' is the
'' root's macro, and http's interface -- which declares Add_ and calls it from a generic
'' body the root instantiates -- is read as the module wrote it, so Add_ still links to
'' the module's. With expansion, the interface declared Broken_ and the build failed.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -d Add_=Broken_ -i tests/modules/src/iface/libs tests/modules/src/iface/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/ifacemacro.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/ifacemacro.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42
